@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` is the runtime construction boundary. The custom runtime supplies its canonical instruction loader, and the factory requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` before returning the agent definition.
+
+The repository does not implement the supplied loader or establish model-provider behavior. Preserve that boundary unless a concrete runtime implementation is added.
